 VERS.                 2.0 : CWLS LOG ASCII STANDARD - VERSION 2.0
 WRAP.                  NO : ONE LINE PER DEPTH STEP
~WELL INFORMATION
 STRT.ft             5000 : START DEPTH
 STOP.ft            10950 : STOP DEPTH
 STEP.ft                 1 : STEP
 NULL.            -999.25 : NULL VALUE
 COMP.           UtahForge : COMPANY
 WELL.         16A (78)-32 : WELL
 FLD.          Milford, UT : FIELD
 SRVC.        Schlumberger : SERVICE COMPANY
~CURVE INFORMATION
 DEPTH.ft         : Measured depth (1 ft bin top)
 GR.gAPI     : Gamma ray (thru-bit)
 CGR.gAPI     : Computed gamma ray, uranium-free (HNGS)
 K.%        : Formation potassium (HNGS)
 TH.ppm      : Formation thorium (HNGS)
 U.ppm      : Formation uranium (HNGS)
 NPHI.v/v      : Thermal neutron porosity, limestone matrix (percent / 100)
 NPHI_SAN.v/v      : Thermal neutron porosity, sandstone matrix (percent / 100)
 DPHI.v/v      : Density porosity, sandstone matrix (as delivered)
 SPHI.v/v      : Sonic total porosity (as delivered)
 DTC.us/ft    : Compressional slowness
 DTS.us/ft    : Shear slowness
 RT10.ohm.m    : Array induction, 10 in depth of investigation
 RT90.ohm.m    : Array induction, 90 in depth of investigation
 C13.in       : Caliper, pads 1-3
 C24.in       : Caliper, pads 2-4
 BS.in       : Bit size
 DEVI.deg      : Hole deviation
 P32.1/ft     : Fracture intensity from the FMI interpretation
 UCS.psi      : Unconfined compressive strength (Schlumberger IsoMechPro)
 YME_STA.Mpsi     : Static Young's modulus (IsoMechPro)
 PR.         : Poisson's ratio (IsoMechPro)
 SV_G.psi/ft   : Vertical stress gradient (IsoMechPro)
 SHMIN_G.psi/ft   : Minimum horizontal stress gradient (IsoMechPro)
 PP_G.psi/ft   : Pore pressure gradient (IsoMechPro)
